{
  "chapter": "langgraph/node-or-function",
  "tier": "drill",
  "notes": [
    "Four questions about a step. Any one of the first three makes it a node; only a step",
    "that needs none of them stays a plain function.",
    "  hasSideEffect       — it touches the world, so a replay must not redo it",
    "  needsResumption     — the run must be able to restart from after this step",
    "  observedSeparately  — someone needs to see this step's timing and outcome alone",
    "  slow                — it takes long enough to matter, which alone decides nothing",
    "`reasons` lists which of the three applied, in that order."
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "a-pure-computation-is-a-plain-function",
      "step": {
        "hasSideEffect": false,
        "needsResumption": false,
        "observedSeparately": false,
        "slow": false
      },
      "result": { "verdict": "function", "reasons": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-side-effect-makes-it-a-node",
      "step": {
        "hasSideEffect": true,
        "needsResumption": false,
        "observedSeparately": false,
        "slow": false
      },
      "result": { "verdict": "node", "reasons": ["side_effect"] }
    },
    {
      "id": "needing-to-resume-after-it-makes-it-a-node",
      "step": {
        "hasSideEffect": false,
        "needsResumption": true,
        "observedSeparately": false,
        "slow": false
      },
      "result": { "verdict": "node", "reasons": ["resumption"] }
    },
    {
      "id": "needing-its-own-trace-span-makes-it-a-node",
      "step": {
        "hasSideEffect": false,
        "needsResumption": false,
        "observedSeparately": true,
        "slow": false
      },
      "result": { "verdict": "node", "reasons": ["observability"] }
    },
    {
      "id": "being-slow-alone-does-not-make-it-a-node",
      "step": {
        "hasSideEffect": false,
        "needsResumption": false,
        "observedSeparately": false,
        "slow": true
      },
      "result": { "verdict": "function", "reasons": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": "every-reason-is-reported-not-just-the-first",
      "step": {
        "hasSideEffect": true,
        "needsResumption": true,
        "observedSeparately": true,
        "slow": true
      },
      "result": {
        "verdict": "node",
        "reasons": ["side_effect", "resumption", "observability"]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "two-reasons-are-both-reported",
      "step": {
        "hasSideEffect": false,
        "needsResumption": true,
        "observedSeparately": true,
        "slow": false
      },
      "result": { "verdict": "node", "reasons": ["resumption", "observability"] }
    }
  ]
}
